a-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"v3-menu-toggle\">MENU <span>☰</span></button></div></header><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"v4-red-symbol\" src=\"/assets/aroz-logo.png\"/><dialog aria-label=\"Main menu\" id=\"v3-menu\"><div class=\"v3-menu-top\"><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">START A PROJECT</a><button aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"v3-close\">MENU ×</button></div><nav><a href=\"/webdesign/index.html\">Web Design</a><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a><a href=\"/projekte/index.html\">Projects</a><a href=\"/agentur/index.html\">Agency</a><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a></nav><a class=\"v3-about-pill\" href=\"/agentur/index.html\">✦ The story of AROZ</a><div class=\"v3-menu-contact\"><span>PROJECT ENQUIRIES</span><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Let's talk ↗</a><p>Schwelm · NRW</p></div><div class=\"v3-menu-services\"><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a></div></dialog>\n<div aria-label=\"Breadcrumb navigation\" class=\"r6-breadcrumb r6-wrap\"><a href=\"../../index.html\">Homepage</a><span>/</span><a href=\"../index.html\">AI SEO</a><span>/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">Entity SEO.</span></div>\n<main id=\"main\"><section aria-labelledby=\"r6-title\" class=\"r6-hero\"><div class=\"r6-hero-copy\"><p class=\"r6-kicker\">AR<span>O</span>Z <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> AI SEO <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> 01 / Understanding</p><h1 id=\"r6-title\"><span class=\"r6-subject\">Entity SEO.</span>Make it clear who is behind the offer.</h1><p class=\"r6-lead\">A business is more than a name in the footer.</p><div class=\"r6-hero-actions\"><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Review business signals <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"r6-text-link\" href=\"#gedanke\">More about our approach <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div><div class=\"r6-meta\"><span>CONTEXT / EVIDENCE / UNDERSTANDING</span><span>Schwelm / NRW</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-hero-art\"><span class=\"r6-art-index\">03 / IDENTITY</span><div aria-label=\"Illustration of our approach\" class=\"concept-art concept-identity\"><div class=\"concept-title\">Connected entities</div><div class=\"entity-map\"><div class=\"entity-main\">Business</div><div class=\"entity-small\"><span>Services</span><span>Location</span><span>Brand</span></div></div><div class=\"concept-caption\">Concept illustration · not actual knowledge graph data</div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-thinking\" id=\"gedanke\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-thinking-grid\"><div class=\"r6-section-side\"><p class=\"r6-small-label\">01 / Understanding</p><div class=\"r6-stamp\">AI SEO<span> / Strategy</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-thinking-main\"><h2 class=\"r6-oversized\">Is it clear who provides which service and where?</h2><div class=\"r6-thinking-bottom\"><p>Entities help distinguish and correctly identify people, businesses, places and services. Conflicting information makes this harder. We review names, contact details, relationships between services and brands, and the pages that explain them.</p><blockquote>A brand is more than a name.</blockquote></div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-focus r6-focus-ai\" id=\"schwerpunkte\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><header class=\"r6-focus-heading\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">02 / Establishing context</span><h2>A clear identity instead of conflicting signals.</h2><p>Businesses, offers and locations are named consistently and connected on relevant pages.</p></header><ol class=\"r6-focus-list\"><li><span>01</span><strong>Consistent identity information</strong></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Clear relationships between topics</strong></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Structured data only where appropriate</strong></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-how\" id=\"ablauf\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-how-grid\"><div class=\"r6-how-intro\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">03 / Ensuring quality</span><h2>Clarify identity.<br/><em>Connect relationships.</em></h2><p>We align the brand, location and services before adding machine-readable relationships.</p></div><ol class=\"r6-steps\"><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">01</span><div><h3>Record the identity</h3><p>Check existing business details and public references for inconsistencies.</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">02</span><div><h3>Organise relationships</h3><p>Clearly connect services, locations and the responsible organisation within the content.</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">03</span><div><h3>Add technical markup</h3><p>Implement suitable structured data correctly and check it against the visible content.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-result\" id=\"ergebnis\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-result-inner\"><div><span class=\"r6-small-label\">04 / Recognising quality</span><h2>Clear signals without artificial claims.</h2></div><div><p>A more clearly described business identity that helps visitors and automated systems understand the organisation.</p><div aria-label=\"Useful details for starting a project\" class=\"r7-brief\"><p class=\"r7-brief-label\">So we can give you a specific answer</p><ul><li>The official brand and its locations</li><li>Public profiles and services offered</li></ul><p class=\"r7-brief-note\">No account access or passwords required.</p></div><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Discuss your entity signals <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-next\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><div class=\"r6-next-title\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">EXPLORE FURTHER / RELATED TOPICS</span><h2>Which information connects?</h2></div><div class=\"r6-links\"><a href=\"../strukturierte-inhalte/index.html\"><span>Structured Content.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../seo/lokales-seo/index.html\"><span>Local SEO.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../ki-sichtbarkeit/index.html\"><span>AI Visibility.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-end\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-end-inner\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">AROZ / CONTACT</span><h2>One brand.<br/><em>One clear picture.</em></h2><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Clarify your brand information <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"r6-footer\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-footer-inner\"><div><img alt=\"AROZ\" height=\"52\" src=\"../../assets/aroz-logo.png\" width=\"112\"/><p>Strategy, web design, SEO and communication.<br/>From Schwelm, for businesses with ambition.</p></div><div class=\"r6-footer-actions\"><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a><a href=\"../../impressum/index.html\">Legal Notice (review draft)</a><a href=\"../../datenschutz/index.html\">Privacy Policy (review draft)</a></div></div></footer>\n\n\n","headScripts":[]}
